{"title":"오컬트 로맨틱 코미디![개정판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bVhgxb/hAMhhTejwt/W8ndihVmmt3qXUl7Jc6a70&filename=th3","synopsis":"오컬트 전문 블로그 '논 오컬텀'의 하나뿐인 기자 티모시는 지금…….\n\n“내가 대박 터뜨려 줄게요.”\n\nB급 호러 무비 전문 배우로 헐리우드 차세대 총아이자,\n각도별로 감탄이 절로 나오는 수려한 외모의 보유자이자,\n익명 공포 게시판에 올라온 목격담의 주인공인\n\n조나단 맥스타즈를 앞에 두고 고민하고 있었다.\n\n정말 저 미스터리한 인간의 손을 잡아도 되는 걸까?\n\n“재미없기만 해.”\n\n비밀로 무장한 (자칭) 티모시의 팬 조나단과,\n이성으로 무장한 현직 오컬트 전문 기자 티모시의\n캘리포니아, 오컬트, 로맨틱, 코미디!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":115,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":181,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":170,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":163,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":119,"change":{"type":"up","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":147,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":147,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":171,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":248,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":246,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":239,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":216,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":187,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":95,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":183,"change":{"type":"down","amount":88}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":221,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":208,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":220,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":244,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":234,"cha